        <name>ParentFuncIdPlusOne</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::MCCVFunctionInfo::ParentFuncIdPlusOne</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= 0</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>If this represents an inlined call site, then ParentFuncIdPlusOne will be the parent function id plus one. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If this represents a normal function, then there is no parent, and ParentFuncIdPlusOne will be FunctionSentinel. If this struct is an unallocated slot in the function info vector, then ParentFuncIdPlusOne will be zero. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
