    <briefdescription>
<para>Information describing a function or inlined call site introduced by .cv_func_id or .cv_inline_site_id. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Accumulates information from .cv_loc directives used with this function&apos;s id or the id of an inlined call site within this function or inlined call site. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
